// /held/cancel: a BYOB reader reads 16 bytes of the step's body, sent with a
// length, and cancels it with a read in flight.
//
// A case of its own because workerd closes the connection after this request
// (see "Steps that close the connection" in tests/conformance/README.md).
{
  "name": "app",
  "main": "index.js",
  "compatibility_date": "2026-01-01"
}
